Date: Tue, 15 Sep 2026 12:08:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ci: repair broken workflow YAML + pin all action refs to SHAs

Repairs 4 workflow files that were invalid YAML (failing CI at parse time):
- test-suite.yml: was a markdown doc wrapping the real workflow in a yaml
  fence; extracted the YAML (175 -> 126 lines).
- dependabot-automerge.yml: ~87 lines of GitHub docs appended after the
  workflow; truncated to real content (121 -> 34 lines).
- secret-scan.yml: 'workflow_dispatch;' -> 'workflow_dispatch:'.
- Auto-Index-Sync.yml: multi-line echo heredoc broke the run block scalar;
  collapsed to a single-line printf.

Also pins every tag-style action ref to a verified full commit SHA, resolving
the org SHA-pinning policy. All 10 workflow files parse; 0 unpinned refs.
